# Local development environment for DinGaming.
#
# These point at the local Supabase stack started by `npm run db:start`
# (a.k.a. `supabase start`). The anon/publishable key below is the standard
# deterministic local demo key and is identical on every machine, so this file
# works out of the box. Do NOT put production credentials here.
#
# For a real deployment, copy .env.example and fill in your hosted values.

